      "updated": 1743081893213,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Browser Caching\n\nUses caches headers to control\nCache-Control: max-\nage=7200,stale-if-\nerror=3600,stale-while-\nrevalidate=60\n\nCheck misses\nX-Cache: MISS, HIT\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jzmBobip0qgrX7wo6Mp6Y",
      "originalText": "Browser Caching\n\nUses caches headers to control\nCache-Control: max-age=7200,stale-if-error=3600,stale-while-revalidate=60\n\nCheck misses\nX-Cache: MISS, HIT\n",
