      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cache ratio\n\nCacheHit - Access data from cache\n\nCacheMiss - Access data from source\n\nCache ratio - CacheHits / CacheHits + CacheMiss",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cache ratio\n\nCacheHit - Access data from cache\n\nCacheMiss - Access data from source\n\nCache ratio - CacheHits / CacheHits + CacheMiss",
