      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1743084107615,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ACID\nAtomicity - All or\nnothing\n\nConsistency - After\ntransaction the db need\nto be in consistent state\n\nIsolation - Each\ntransaction is\nindependent\n\nDurability - If a\ntransaction is commited\nthe data will stay",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "gGLHHx10YtTr_plTnkP9f",
      "originalText": "ACID\nAtomicity - All or nothing\n\nConsistency - After transaction the db need to be in consistent state \n\nIsolation - Each transaction is independent\n\nDurability - If a transaction is commited the data will stay",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
